{%- comment -%}
  The consolation offer page — the giveaway's ENTIRE revenue event (spec §7.3).

  Nothing was sold during the 30-day entry period by design, so this page and
  its three sends are the whole return on $1,500 of ad spend. It goes live on
  draw day and closes seven days later.

  USE THE EXISTING CLASS VOCABULARY. `theme/assets/giveaway.css` is a closed set
  — `.gv-entered`, `.gv-lead`, `.gv-copy`, `.gv-ladder`, `.gv-fine`, and the
  `.gv-next` block (`-shot`, `-copy`, `-eyebrow`, `-body`, `-price`, `-cta`,
  `-fine`). The first version of this page invented `.gv-next-card`,
  `.gv-next-img`, `.gv-entered-main`, `.gv-entered-title/-lede` and
  `.gv-ladder-title/-body/-fine`, none of which exist. Headings still rendered,
  because `.gv-entered h1`/`h2` are descendant selectors — which is exactly why
  it looked *almost* right and the missing product shot was the only visible
  symptom. Check a class against the stylesheet before using it here.

  ONE TAP, ONE VARIANT. The CTA is a cart permalink that preloads all 12 bars
  with the discount code applied. Two things about that are load-bearing:

    1. It must preload TWELVE, not six. A Shopify BXGY marks 6 of 12 as free —
       it does not ADD the free ones. A cart holding 6 shows $66 with no
       discount visible and reads as a broken offer.
    2. Pure Unscented only. One variant removes the scent picker, the
       out-of-stock-variant handling and a whole class of wrong-product bug,
       and it matches the prize itself.

  THE DURATION CLAIM IS THE CONSERVATIVE END, AND IT IS PER PERSON. Bar soap is
  25 days/bar (merchant figure, range 20-30 — Sean, 2026-08-02, superseding a
  47-day reorder gap that was never consumption). Six free bars is ~150 days at
  the midpoint; this page claims ~4 months (120 days), the 20-day end. It says
  "for one person" out loud because a shared bar does not last 25 days, and the
  spec gated this claim on the household answer — which this page cannot see,
  because the confirmation redirect is static and carries no entrant identity.
  Pinned by tests/lib/giveaway-consolation-offer.test.js via assertDurationClaim.

  NO PURCHASE NECESSARY STAYS ON THIS PAGE. Spec §8 requires it here, not only
  in the rules — this is a page selling to sweepstakes entrants.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign cart_url = '/cart/45828179951786:12?discount=GIVEAWAY6X6'
  assign closes_human = 'September 23, 2026'
  assign set_handle = 'sensitive-skin-starter-set'
  assign set_image = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0270/1911/6579/files/frame-01-what-arrives.jpg?v=1785635169'
-%}

{{ 'giveaway.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="gv-entered" data-gv-offer>

  <h1>We drew the winner. It wasn't you.</h1>
  <p class="gv-lead">
    So here's the next best thing — the same soap, at half price, for one week only.
  </p>

  <div class="gv-ladder">
    <h2>Buy 6 bars, get 6 free</h2>
    <p class="gv-next-price">$66 <span class="gv-fine">for 12 bars — $132 value</span></p>
    <p class="gv-copy">
      Twelve bars of Pure Unscented Moisturizing Coconut Soap. The six free
      ones are roughly <strong>four months of soap for one person</strong>.
    </p>
    <p class="gv-copy">
      Fragrance-free · Free shipping · 30-day no-questions guarantee
    </p>

    <a class="gv-next-cta" href="{{ cart_url }}">Get 12 bars for $66</a>

    <p class="gv-fine">
      Offer closes <strong>{{ closes_human }}</strong>. One per customer.
      Discount applies automatically at checkout.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="gv-ladder">
    <h2>Why we're doing this</h2>
    <p class="gv-copy">
      You entered to win three years of free soap and you didn't win — one
      person did. This is the closest we can get for everyone else: the same
      Pure Unscented bar that was the prize, at the lowest price we've ever
      put on it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <p class="gv-fine">
    No purchase necessary to have entered the giveaway. A purchase did not and
    does not improve anyone's chances of winning, and purchases never earned
    entries. This offer is separate from the promotion and is open to everyone.
    <a href="/pages/giveaway-official-rules">Official rules</a>.
    This promotion is not sponsored, endorsed, or administered by Meta.
  </p>

  <aside class="gv-next">
    <div class="gv-next-shot">
      <img src="{{ set_image }}&width=600" alt="The Sensitive Skin Moisturizing Set" width="600" height="600" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="gv-next-copy">
      <p class="gv-next-eyebrow">Prefer something for sensitive skin?</p>
      <h2>The Sensitive Skin Moisturizing Set</h2>
      <p class="gv-next-body">
        Body lotion and body cream — two products, eight ingredients, no
        fragrance. Three of these shipped with the giveaway prize.
      </p>
      <p class="gv-next-price">$46.80</p>
      <a class="gv-next-cta" href="/products/{{ set_handle }}">See the Set</a>
      <p class="gv-next-fine">Full price — the soap offer above is the discounted one.</p>
    </div>
  </aside>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Giveaway offer",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Giveaway offer" }]
}
{% endschema %}
